  owner routing is recorded in testing-inventory/README.md and its linked
  artifacts; proposed destinations are in testing-inventory/Phase2.LayoutDecisions.md
  and its move maps. This document does not
  authorize test removal. The four test projects are
  VanillaGraphicsExpanded.Tests, OpenGLInterceptionGenerator.Tests, ShaderBuildTool.Tests,
  and ShaderContractGenerator.Tests. A source-file count is not a runtime-case count.
  Phase 3 is complete after the user-authorized primary-agent final review and
